01:02:56,666 --> 01:03:02,666
Raise Your Voice is a 2004 American teen musical drama film
directed by Sean McNamara and starring Hilary Duff.

12
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:46,000
The film received negative reviews and grossed $14.9
million against a $15 million budget.

13
01:14:23,333 --> 01:14:29,333
Three songs by Duff were featured in Raise Your Voice, all of
which appear on her eponymous third album.

14
01:20:06,666 --> 01:20:12,666
"Someone's Watching Over Me" is performed by her
character during the film's climax.

15
